<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs firm - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs firm - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were firm. Demand moderate for a light run. Top $59.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>				Country			     Plant</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs.  57.00-58.50, Few 59.00	 58.00-59.50</p>
