<p>	  210-230 lbs.  47.00-52.00</p>
<p>Sows:  Steady in a very light test. Top 48.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-400 lbs. 41.50-42.50</p>
<p>	  400-500 lbs. 43.00-45.00</p>
<p>	  500-600 lbs. 46.00-47.00</p>
<p>	 over 600 lbs. 47.00-48.00</p>
